/**
 * Base64-encoded brand assets for PDF generation
 *
 * These large base64 strings are kept in a separate file to enable
 * code-splitting. The bundler will only load this module when PDF
 * generation is triggered, keeping the main bundle small.
 *
 * Brand fonts: Montserrat (headings), Geologica (body), Cormorant Garamond (narrative)
 * Aligned with el-templo-web design system (Phase 39)
 */

